		<resource name="settings_message_filenamepattern">The following placeholders will be replaced automatically with the defined format:
${YYYY} year, 4 digits
${MM} month, 2 digits
${DD} day, 2 digits
${hh} hour, 2 digits
${mm} minute, 2 digits
${ss} second, 2 digits
${NUM} number increment, 6 digits
${title} Window title
${user} Windows user
${domain} Windows domain
${hostname} Computer name

You can also create dynamic locations for EvidenciasSQA by simply using the backslash symbol (\) to separate folder and file names.
Example: the format ${YYYY}-${MM}-${DD}\${hh}-${mm}-${ss}
will create a folder for the current day inside your default storage folder, for example: 2008-06-29, and the names of the contained images will be based on the current time,
for example: 11_58_32 (plus the extension defined in the settings)</resource>
